<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/connectivity.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head section-head--split">
  <div class="section-head__copy" data-reveal>
    <span class="eyebrow">Network & Security</span>
    <h2>Your network. Fast, secure and always on</h2>
    <p>Every call, every sale and every system your team uses depends on your network. We specialise in connecting Australian enterprises on the best available fibre and nbn™ services, then protecting that connection with layered security and SD-WAN. Our local team keeps you online, protected and running fast, wherever you operate. </p>
  <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
 <img class="section-head__img" data-reveal src="/images/cisco-meraki-cropped.webp" alt="Cisco Meraki security" loading="lazy">
</div>

    <div class="feature-grid">

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Carrier agnostic</h3>
        <p>We access all Tier 1 carrier fibre, so we choose the right connection for what your business demands: nbn™, Telstra, AAPT, Optus or Aussie fibre networks. </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.4 8.4-8 10-4.6-1.6-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Carrier-diverse networks</h3>
        <p>Every solution uses carrier-diverse pathways for your second and third layers of redundancy, including 5G backup, so a single outage doesn't take you offline. </a>.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>SD-WAN</h3>
        <p>SD-WAN is our specialty. We design and support it across Cisco Meraki, Fortinet and Ubiquiti UniFi Cloud Gateway, with threat protection included. </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17l5-5 4 4 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Fully managed or co-managed</h3>
        <p>Our service is fully managed. If your in-house IT team wants hands-on access, we'll co-manage with you, which many MSPs won't do. </p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12h16M4 6h16M4 18h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Your choice of data centre</h3>
        <p>Bring the data centre you prefer. We support NextDC, Equinix, Micron21 and others.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Firewall and VPN</h3>
        <p>Your firewall is your first line of network defence. We configure, deploy and fully manage it to suit your needs, including secure VPN tunnels for remote working. </p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="nbn-panel" style="margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
  <div class="nbn-panel__grid">
    <div class="nbn-panel__copy">
      <h2>Built so your business never goes offline</h2>
      <p>Every other system you rely on depends on your network, so we never leave it to a single connection. Each solution uses carrier-diverse pathways: primary fibre, a second carrier for backup, and 5G as the third layer. If one fails, the next takes over and your team keeps working.</p>
      <p>Not sure how resilient your network is today? We'll review it with you at no cost.</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/network-resilience.webp" alt="Network resilience diagram" class="nbn-panel__img" loading="lazy">
  </div>
</div>

    <div class="capability-block">
  <span class="eyebrow">OUR SECURITY PARTNERS & CERTIFICATIONS</span>
  <div class="cert-logos">
    <img src="/images/cert-cisco.webp" alt="Cisco Meraki Certified" loading="lazy">
    <img src="/images/cert-fortinet.webp" alt="Fortinet Certified" loading="lazy">
    <img src="/images/cert-ubiquiti.webp" alt="Ubiquiti Certified" loading="lazy">
  </div>
</div>

  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
